									<p>Returns &amp; Exchanges are accepted on unworn items within 14 days of order receipt and require an RA number. Items must be received within 10 days of RA issue. Items discounted 50% or more are Final Sale.</p><p>You may request an RA Number through: </p><p>Email : <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="e093888f90a0898e8e8f9685838f9594959285ce838f8d">[email&#160;protected]</a><br />Phone : + 1 222 432 8888</p><p>During regular business hours, email requests are immediately processed. If, for any reason, you don&#8217;t receive a timely response, please give us a call.</p><p>Once an RA number is received, please specify if you want an exchange or refund. Securely pack items and send them using an insured carrier:</p><p>Innoce Couture INC.<br />217 Tueri Junction, New York,<br />NY 10002</p>								</div>
